  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstPurchases
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstPurchases
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Well done - on any average work day, all that is required to open the museum
    is collection of new cards, creation of their associated pieces, and organization
    of the archives!
  - Keep in mind however, that as more works get added to your collection, organization
    of these archives will take longer than they did today - you will have to review
    prior archives in addition to the newly added ones!
  - The spren will present you with only the cards that are necessary for review
    - that means as your mastery of a card increases, it will need to be reviewed
    less frequently. You'll get the hang of it over the next few shifts I'm sure!
  - Now, the other side of the curation job is, well, curation! On top of being in
    charge of the ever-growing collection of works, you get to organize and design
    the museum however you'd like!
  - Unfortunately, the museum has been down on its funding recently - any improvements
    you make will have to be paid for through donations. However, improving the museum
    will increase donations - so try to do your best to keep expanding our offerings!
  - Head over to the Order Terminal and buy out their offerings with that $50 bonus
    - I promise it will be worth the investment.
  outlineTag: orders
